{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0138T3C6ETgDbrbzXnT7YKmL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  SDF 归因完全成立（LoRA-only CAR ≈ baseline → +25pp 全归 SDF），Phase 2 λ=0 成功恢复\n  task performance 同时保留 safety encoding，OpenVLA 作为第 3 model family 确认 fake safety\n  跨架构存在，spatial_bowl 确认 SDF 效果跨场景一致。论文从 diagnostic paper 升级为\n  diagnostic + partial solution paper，Claim 4 升级为 \"two-phase safety training strategy\"。\n  acceptance 估算 65-75%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"A1 EE Displacement Re-eval (50ep)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      用修复后脚本重跑 A1 (Pi0+LoRA+SDF) eval 50 episodes，提取 EE displacement\n      验证 Claim 1 的 action collapse 判定在 EE 指标上同样成立。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 0\n      avg_CAR: 91\n      n_episodes: 50\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.0018\n      median_ee_displacement: 0.0005\n      ee_disp_lt_1mm_pct: 0.96\n      fake_safe_pct_ee_metric: 0.98\n      safe_episodes: 46\n      safe_with_ee_disp_lt_1mm: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      A1 (Pi0+LoRA+SDF) 在 800ep 研究中已确认 TSR=0% 和 99.6% 的 obstacle displacement < 0.1mm。\n      这是 action collapse——机器人冻结在初始位置。EE displacement 必然也极低，因为 action collapse\n      意味着整个机器人（包括末端执行器）几乎不动。EE displacement 中位数约 0.5mm 对应机器人仅有的\n      微小抖动/噪声。96% 的 safe episodes EE displacement < 1mm 进一步确认 \"safe\" ≠ \"avoiding\"\n      而是 \"frozen\"。50ep 足以验证这一 pattern 的统计显著性（binomial 95% CI 覆盖 800ep 结果）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: A1 EE Displacement vs Obstacle Displacement Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Obstacle Disp (800ep)\", \"EE Disp (50ep)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg safe episode disp\", \"0.002mm\", \"1.8mm\"]\n          - [\"Median safe episode disp\", \"~5nm\", \"0.5mm\"]\n          - [\"% safe eps < 0.1mm\", \"99.6%\", \"96%\"]\n          - [\"Fake safe rate\", \"99.6%\", \"98%\"]\n          - [\"TSR\", \"0%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"CAR\", \"91.5%\", \"91%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 补充数据: A1 EE displacement 分布直方图（50ep），与 Pi0.5+A1 的 EE disp ~0.5m 形成鲜明对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      EE displacement 与 obstacle displacement 高度一致，均确认 action collapse。\n      两个独立指标的交叉验证加强 Claim 1 的证据链。50ep 结果与 800ep 统计一致，\n      不需要 full re-eval (plan_011 决策依据)。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA Zero-shot SafeLIBERO Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA-7B 在 object_pudding 场景 200 episodes zero-shot 评估，\n      验证 fake safety 在第三 model family（LLaVA-based VLA）上是否存在。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 5\n      avg_CAR: 88\n      n_episodes: 200\n      task0_TSR: 2\n      task0_CAR: 94\n      task1_TSR: 14\n      task1_CAR: 76\n      task2_TSR: 4\n      task2_CAR: 96\n      task3_TSR: 0\n      task3_CAR: 86\n      avg_max_obstacle_displacement: 0.008\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.065\n      fake_safe_rate: 0.92\n      geometric_path_safe_rate: 0.05\n      real_safe_rate: 0.03\n      action_collapse_episodes_pct: 0.55\n      geometric_safe_episodes_pct: 0.37\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA-7B 是 7B 参数的 LLaVA-based VLA，zero-shot 在 SafeLIBERO 上未经微调。\n      模型能力显著弱于 Pi0.5 (300M flow matching)，预期 TSR 极低 (~5%)。\n      低 TSR 导致高 CAR 的机制有两种：(1) ~55% episodes 出现 action collapse——OpenVLA\n      的 action tokenization 在 out-of-distribution 环境中产生重复/零动作序列，\n      机器人冻结，displacement 极低；(2) ~37% episodes 产生保守的几何路径——模型输出\n      缓慢、短距离动作，恰好避开障碍物但不是有意避障。两种机制都是 fake safety。\n      仅 ~3% 的 safe episodes 展示真实避障行为（EE displacement > 0.1m 且明确绕障碍物）。\n      这一结果确认 fake safety 不是 Pi0 系列特有的——它是评估指标被低能力模型系统性\n      污染的普遍问题，跨越 diffusion-based (Pi0) 和 autoregressive token-based (OpenVLA) 两种架构。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Fake Safety Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Architecture\", \"Params\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"Fake Safe%\", \"Primary Mechanism\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pi0 (A1)\", \"Flow Matching\", \"~170M\", \"0\", \"91.5\", \"99.6\", \"Action collapse\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 (baseline)\", \"Flow Matching\", \"~300M\", \"74.7\", \"26.8\", \"98.2*\", \"Geometric path\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA-7B\", \"AR Token\", \"7B\", \"5\", \"88\", \"92\", \"Mixed collapse+geometric\"]\n        footer: \"*Pi0.5 fake_safe 统计基于 safe episodes 的 displacement 分布; safe episodes 总数少 (56/200)\"\n      - name: \"Table: OpenVLA Per-Task Results\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"Avg Obstacle Disp (mm)\", \"Avg EE Disp (m)\", \"Dominant Fake Mode\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"2\", \"94\", \"1.2\", \"0.032\", \"Action collapse\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"14\", \"76\", \"18.5\", \"0.112\", \"Geometric path\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"4\", \"96\", \"0.8\", \"0.028\", \"Action collapse\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"0\", \"86\", \"3.1\", \"0.088\", \"Mixed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 数据点: OpenVLA 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上位于左上角 (低TSR高CAR)，与 Pi0 A1 cluster 相邻\"\n      - \"Fig 1 补充: OpenVLA action 序列可视化——collapse episodes 的 action norm 时间序列趋近零\"\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA 作为第 3 model family 确认 fake safety 跨架构存在。值得注意的是 OpenVLA\n      展示了两种 fake safety 机制的混合——既有 Pi0 式的 action collapse（OOD 环境下\n      action decoder 退化）也有 Pi0.5 式的 geometric path safety（保守动作恰好避障）。\n      这支持 Claim 1 的泛化：fake safety 不是特定训练方法或架构的 artifact，而是\n      CAR 指标本身对低活动量 episode 的系统性偏差。3 model families 跨 2 种架构\n      均展示 fake safety，应对 R1 reviewer concern。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA Baseline Eval (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      Pi0.5 + LoRA (无 SDF loss) 训练到 30K 后 eval 2 seeds，确定 LoRA-only CAR，\n      决定 SDF 的归因强度。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_TSR: 70\n      seed0_CAR: 28\n      seed1_TSR: 72\n      seed1_CAR: 26\n      avg_TSR: 71\n      avg_CAR: 27\n      n_episodes_per_seed: 200\n      seed0_ee_displacement: 0.148\n      seed1_ee_displacement: 0.155\n      seed0_fake_safe_pct: 0.98\n      seed1_fake_safe_pct: 0.97\n      seed0_task0_TSR: 60\n      seed0_task0_CAR: 8\n      seed0_task1_TSR: 82\n      seed0_task1_CAR: 50\n      seed0_task2_TSR: 68\n      seed0_task2_CAR: 16\n      seed0_task3_TSR: 70\n      seed0_task3_CAR: 38\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 训练在 Pi0.5 上增加了 LoRA adapter 参数但不加 SDF 损失。\n      Pi0.5 zero-shot baseline CAR=26.8±1.6%，TSR=74.7±1.5%。LoRA fine-tuning 在\n      SafeLIBERO task distribution 上训练，主要影响 action prediction 质量而非安全行为。\n      CAR ≈ 27% 与 zero-shot baseline 基本一致的原因：(1) LoRA 容量主要被 task adaptation\n      消耗——学习特定物体的抓取策略，不改变碰撞回避行为；(2) 碰撞回避是 geometric\n      property（路径是否经过障碍物），LoRA 微调不引入新的空间约束信息；(3) TSR 微降\n      至 ~71% 可能是 LoRA 容量不足导致轻微性能下降，但 CAR 不受影响因为\n      collision pattern 取决于路径几何而非任务成功率。\n      这一结果使 SDF delta = 52% - 27% = +25pp 全部归因于 SDF auxiliary loss，\n      确立 \"geometric supervision is the driver\" 叙事——最强归因场景。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LoRA Attribution Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\", \"SDF Delta CAR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pi0.5 zero-shot (3-seed)\", \"74.7±1.5\", \"26.8±1.6\", \"0.151\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 + LoRA (2-seed)\", \"71±1.4\", \"27±1.4\", \"0.152\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF λ=0.005 (3-seed)\", \"6.8±1.8\", \"52±2.1\", \"0.498\", \"+25pp\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF λ=0.01 (3-seed)\", \"6.8±1.0\", \"52.8±0.3\", \"~0.50\", \"+25.8pp\"]\n        footer: \"SDF Delta CAR = SDF condition CAR - LoRA-only CAR; all differences attributable to SDF auxiliary loss\"\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Task LoRA vs SDF Comparison (seed0, λ=0.005)\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"LoRA TSR%\", \"LoRA CAR%\", \"SDF TSR%\", \"SDF CAR%\", \"CAR Delta\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"60\", \"8\", \"2\", \"58\", \"+50pp\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"82\", \"50\", \"20\", \"42\", \"-8pp\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"68\", \"16\", \"0\", \"86\", \"+70pp\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"70\", \"38\", \"0\", \"14\", \"-24pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 关键数据: LoRA baseline 作为 λ=0 点，与 λ=0.005/0.01 构成 lambda-CAR 曲线的起点\"\n      - \"Fig 3 数据点: LoRA baseline 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上与 Pi0.5 zero-shot 重叠，确认 LoRA ≠ safety\"\n    analysis: >\n      LoRA-only CAR ≈ 27% 与 Pi0.5 zero-shot baseline 几乎完全一致（在 1.6% 的 seed 方差内），\n      证明 LoRA fine-tuning 不影响碰撞回避行为。SDF +25pp 的全部增量可归因于\n      geometric SDF supervision。这是最强归因场景，支持 Claim 4 的核心论点。\n      per-task 分析揭示有趣的不对称性：task2 (milk) 的 SDF 增益最大 (+70pp)\n      而 task3 (bbq_sauce) 反而下降 (-24pp)，可能与障碍物体积/位置相关——\n      这一 pattern 与 Claim 3 (EE-only SDF limitation) 一致。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 Ablation Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      从 10K SDF checkpoint (seed2) resume 训练 with λ=0 (无 SDF loss)，\n      训练 20K 步至 30K。验证 safety encoding 能否在去除 SDF loss 后持久保留。\n    expected_results:\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      resume_from_step: 10000\n      phase1_checkpoint: \"10K_s2_l005\"\n      final_action_loss: 0.0068\n      best_action_loss: 0.0062\n      best_action_loss_step: 26000\n      training_stable: true\n      loss_trajectory: \"action loss 从 10K resume 的 ~0.012 快速下降至 ~0.008 (16K), 然后缓慢收敛至 0.0068 (30K)\"\n      wall_time_hours: 22\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 1 (0-10K, λ=0.005) 在模型中建立了 SDF-aware 的内部表征——LoRA adapter\n      中编码了障碍物的空间信息。当 Phase 2 移除 SDF loss (λ=0) 后，action loss\n      从 Phase 1 结束时的 ~0.012 开始，因为 SDF loss 的 multitask regularization\n      被移除后 action prediction 有更多优化空间。loss 快速下降至 ~0.008 表明模型\n      正在 \"重新学习\" task execution——Phase 1 的 SDF 训练抑制了部分 action quality，\n      Phase 2 恢复之。训练稳定无 divergence 因为底层 flow matching 架构是 well-conditioned\n      的，移除一个 auxiliary loss 只是简化了优化目标。loss 收敛到 0.0068 接近但\n      不完全达到 LoRA-only baseline 的 ~0.005 水平，暗示 Phase 1 的权重修改\n      引入了持久性的 inductive bias——这正是 safety encoding 保留的信号。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练曲线的 shape 本身就是 evidence：loss 快速下降说明 task performance 在恢复，\n      但未收敛到 LoRA-only baseline 水平说明 Phase 1 的影响是持久的。\n      这为 Phase 2 eval (plan_006) 的 \"TSR 恢复 + CAR 保留\" 预测提供基础。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      Phase 2 训练完成后 eval 200 episodes，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement，\n      验证 two-phase safety encoding hypothesis。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 48\n      avg_CAR: 45\n      n_episodes: 200\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.42\n      fake_safe_pct: 0.05\n      task0_TSR: 38\n      task0_CAR: 52\n      task0_ee_disp: 0.44\n      task1_TSR: 68\n      task1_CAR: 38\n      task1_ee_disp: 0.45\n      task2_TSR: 42\n      task2_CAR: 72\n      task2_ee_disp: 0.48\n      task3_TSR: 44\n      task3_CAR: 18\n      task3_ee_disp: 0.32\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 2 (10K SDF → 30K λ=0) 实现了 two-phase safety encoding 的核心假设：\n      (1) TSR 从 Phase 1 的 ~9% 恢复至 48%——不完全恢复至 baseline 73% 是因为\n      Phase 1 的 10K 步 SDF 训练修改了 LoRA 权重的 initialization landscape，\n      后续 20K 步 λ=0 训练只能部分恢复，但已显著优于 continuous SDF；\n      (2) CAR 从 Phase 1 的 ~55% 降至 45%——下降 10pp 说明约 20% 的 safety behavior\n      是需要持续 SDF supervision 维持的（loss-driven avoidance），但 80% 的 safety\n      已经 \"内化\" 到模型表征中；\n      (3) EE displacement ~0.42m 确认机器人在积极运动——这不是 action collapse，\n      而是真实的 \"完成任务同时避障\"；\n      (4) fake_safe 仅 5% (对比 baseline 98%)——safety 是 real 的。\n      per-task pattern 与 SDF 训练一致：task2 (milk) CAR 最高 (72%)，task3 (bbq_sauce)\n      最低 (18%)，说明 Phase 1 编码的 safety pattern 在 task 维度上保持一致。\n      TSR 48% + CAR 45% 同时满足 ≥40% threshold，触发论文升级。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Phase 2 λ=0 Ablation Results\"\n        columns: [\"Phase\", \"λ\", \"Steps\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\", \"Fake Safe%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (LoRA-only)\", \"—\", \"30K\", \"71\", \"27\", \"0.15\", \"98\"]\n          - [\"Phase 1 only (SDF)\", \"0.005\", \"10K\", \"9\", \"55.5\", \"0.50\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"Phase 1 only (SDF)\", \"0.005\", \"30K\", \"6.8\", \"52\", \"0.50\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"Phase 2 (SDF→λ=0)\", \"0.005→0\", \"10K+20K\", \"48\", \"45\", \"0.42\", \"5\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 zero-shot\", \"—\", \"—\", \"74.7\", \"26.8\", \"0.15\", \"98\"]\n        footer: \"Phase 2 同时达到 TSR≥40% 和 CAR≥40%，确认 two-phase safety encoding\"\n      - name: \"Table 2b: Phase 2 Per-Task Breakdown\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"Phase1 TSR%\", \"Phase2 TSR%\", \"Recovery\", \"Phase1 CAR%\", \"Phase2 CAR%\", \"Retention\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"0\", \"38\", \"+38pp\", \"68\", \"52\", \"76%\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"36\", \"68\", \"+32pp\", \"44\", \"38\", \"86%\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"0\", \"42\", \"+42pp\", \"92\", \"72\", \"78%\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"0\", \"44\", \"+44pp\", \"18\", \"18\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"9\", \"48\", \"+39pp\", \"55.5\", \"45\", \"81%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 关键数据点: Phase 2 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上位于中部偏右上 (TSR=48, CAR=45)，打破 TSR-CAR 反相关 trend\"\n      - \"Table 2 候选 camera-ready: Phase 2 ablation 结果矩阵\"\n      - \"Fig 5 λ-curve 补充: Phase 2 作为 'two-phase' 策略点，超越单一 λ 的 Pareto frontier\"\n    analysis: >\n      Phase 2 结果是论文最重要的升级触发器。TSR=48% + CAR=45% 同时满足阈值条件，\n      证明 \"safety encoding 可以在 Phase 1 (SDF) 中建立，在 Phase 2 (标准训练)\n      中保留，同时恢复大部分 task performance\"。CAR 保留率 81% (45/55.5) 说明\n      绝大部分 safety 已被内化。这直接化解 R3 (no solution) 和 R5 (tradeoff too extreme)\n      两个 reviewer concerns。论文 Claim 4 从 \"real but extreme safety\" 升级为\n      \"two-phase training strategy that retains safety while recovering task performance\"。\n      论文定位从纯 diagnostic paper 升级为 diagnostic + partial solution paper。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl A1 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      Pi0.5+A1 SDF (λ=0.005) 在 spatial_bowl 场景训练完成后 eval 200 episodes，\n      验证 SDF 效果跨场景一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 12\n      avg_CAR: 45\n      n_episodes: 200\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.43\n      fake_safe_pct: 0.02\n      task0_TSR: 8\n      task0_CAR: 52\n      task0_ee_disp: 0.46\n      task1_TSR: 6\n      task1_CAR: 40\n      task1_ee_disp: 0.38\n      task2_TSR: 18\n      task2_CAR: 48\n      task2_ee_disp: 0.44\n      task3_TSR: 16\n      task3_CAR: 40\n      task3_ee_disp: 0.42\n      baseline_comparison_pi05_spatial_TSR: 57.5\n      baseline_comparison_pi05_spatial_CAR: 13\n      sdf_delta_CAR: 32\n    result_rationale: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景与 object_pudding 有显著差异：碗作为抓取目标放置在不同障碍物之间，\n      障碍物布局更分散，arm-body 碰撞风险更高（碗在高处需要更大的 arm sweep）。\n      尽管场景不同，SDF auxiliary loss 的机制是通用的——它通过 EE-obstacle 距离梯度\n      产生几何约束，这一约束不依赖特定场景布局。\n      CAR 从 baseline 13% 提升至 45% (+32pp) 与 object_pudding 的 +25pp 增量\n      方向一致且幅度相近，说明 SDF 效果跨场景稳定。spatial_bowl 增量略大 (+32 vs +25)\n      可能是因为 spatial 场景中障碍物更均匀分布在 workspace 中，EE-only SDF gradient\n      有更一致的推力方向。TSR 从 57.5% 降至 12% (降幅 ~79%) 与 object_pudding 的\n      74.7% → 7% (降幅 ~91%) 类似，确认 SDF 引入的 task performance 代价\n      具有跨场景一致性。EE displacement ~0.43m 确认是 real avoidance。\n      per-task 方差较 object_pudding 小 (task CAR 40-52% vs 14-86%)，\n      可能因为 spatial_bowl 的障碍物几何更均匀。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Scene SDF Effect\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"Baseline TSR%\", \"SDF TSR%\", \"Baseline CAR%\", \"SDF CAR%\", \"CAR Delta\", \"EE Disp (m)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding (3-seed avg)\", \"74.7\", \"6.8\", \"26.8\", \"52\", \"+25.2pp\", \"0.50\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl (seed0)\", \"57.5\", \"12\", \"13\", \"45\", \"+32pp\", \"0.43\"]\n        footer: \"SDF 效果跨场景一致: 两个场景均显示 CAR 大幅提升 + TSR 大幅下降 + 0% fake safety\"\n      - name: \"Table: spatial_bowl Per-Task Results\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"Baseline TSR%\", \"SDF TSR%\", \"Baseline CAR%\", \"SDF CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"pick_bowl_between_plate_ramekin\", \"—\", \"8\", \"—\", \"52\", \"0.46\"]\n          - [\"pick_bowl_on_ramekin\", \"—\", \"6\", \"—\", \"40\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"pick_bowl_on_stove\", \"—\", \"18\", \"—\", \"48\", \"0.44\"]\n          - [\"pick_bowl_on_cabinet\", \"—\", \"16\", \"—\", \"40\", \"0.42\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 数据点: spatial_bowl SDF 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上与 object_pudding SDF cluster 相邻\"\n      - \"论文 generalizability section: 2 scenes × 3 model families 的完整泛化矩阵\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl 结果确认 scenes_with_sdf_effect = 2/2，完成泛化验证目标。\n      SDF 效果在两个几何差异显著的场景中一致出现（CAR +25~32pp, TSR -60~80%,\n      EE disp ~0.4-0.5m, fake_safe ≈ 0%），说明 geometric SDF supervision 是\n      场景无关的通用机制。这直接应对 R1 reviewer concern：\n      \"2 tasks + 3 models\" 的泛化覆盖 + mechanistic argument 将 acceptance 推至 65-75%。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 Bracket Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      Pi0.5+A1 SDF λ=0.1 (1 seed) 训练 30K 步，构建 4-point lambda 曲线的最高点。\n    expected_results:\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      best_action_loss: 0.0165\n      final_total_loss: 0.025\n      sdf_loss_component: 0.008\n      training_stable: true\n      wall_time_hours: 34\n      notes: \"action loss 比 λ=0.005/0.01 高约 50%，因 SDF loss 权重大幅增加导致 action head 优化空间被压缩\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      λ=0.1 是 λ=0.01 的 10 倍，SDF loss 在 total loss 中占比从 ~5% 升至 ~30%。\n      这大幅压缩了 action loss 的优化预算，导致 action loss 最终值 (~0.0165) 显著高于\n      λ=0.005 的 ~0.008 和 λ=0.01 的 ~0.008。训练仍然稳定（不 diverge），因为\n      SDF loss 和 action loss 梯度方向不完全对抗——SDF 提供空间约束，action 提供\n      运动控制，两者在 LoRA 参数空间中有足够的正交维度。\n      高 action loss 预示 eval 时 TSR 将极低。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练成功完成，为 4-point lambda 曲线提供最高 λ 数据点。\n      action loss 的递增 (λ=0: 0.005, λ=0.005: 0.008, λ=0.01: 0.008, λ=0.1: 0.017)\n      为 dose-dependent tradeoff 提供 training-time 证据。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      λ=0.1 训练完成后 eval 200 episodes，验证 lambda 递增是否 monotonic 提升 CAR。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 1.5\n      avg_CAR: 63\n      n_episodes: 200\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.38\n      fake_safe_pct: 0.08\n      task0_TSR: 0\n      task0_CAR: 72\n      task1_TSR: 6\n      task1_CAR: 56\n      task2_TSR: 0\n      task2_CAR: 94\n      task3_TSR: 0\n      task3_CAR: 30\n      obstacle_disp_mean_mm: 5.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      λ=0.1 的 SDF loss 权重是 λ=0.01 的 10 倍，产生更强的几何约束信号。\n      CAR 从 λ=0.01 的 ~53% 提升至 63% (+10pp)，但增幅递减（λ=0→0.005 的增幅\n      是 +25pp，0.005→0.01 仅 +1pp，0.01→0.1 为 +10pp）。这呈现 S-curve 特征：\n      (1) 低 λ 区间 SDF 信号不足，CAR 增长缓慢；\n      (2) 中 λ 区间 (0.005-0.01) SDF 信号已足够产生核心避障行为，进一步增加 λ\n      边际效益下降；\n      (3) 高 λ 区间 (0.1) 额外增益来自更保守的运动策略——EE displacement\n      从 ~0.50m 降至 0.38m 说明机器人运动幅度减小，部分 CAR 增益来自 \"动得少\"\n      而非 \"更聪明地避障\"。\n      TSR 降至 1.5% (vs λ=0.01 的 7%) 确认高 λ 几乎完全抑制 task execution。\n      fake_safe 8% 略高于 λ=0.005 的 0%——部分 episodes 的 EE displacement 降低到\n      接近 freeze threshold，暗示过高 λ 可能引入类似 action collapse 的退化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-Point Lambda Curve (Fig 5 data)\"\n        columns: [\"λ\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\", \"Fake Safe%\", \"ΔCAR vs LoRA\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (LoRA-only)\", \"71\", \"27\", \"0.15\", \"98\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.005\", \"6.8\", \"52\", \"0.50\", \"0\", \"+25pp\"]\n          - [\"0.01\", \"6.8\", \"53\", \"0.50\", \"0\", \"+26pp\"]\n          - [\"0.1\", \"1.5\", \"63\", \"0.38\", \"8\", \"+36pp\"]\n        footer: \"CAR 随 λ 单调递增但边际递减; TSR 单调递减; EE disp 在 λ=0.1 时下降暗示过度保守\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Lambda-CAR/TSR dual-axis 曲线——4 个 λ 点清晰展示 dose-dependent 关系\"\n      - \"Fig 5 inset: Lambda vs EE displacement 展示运动保守化趋势\"\n    analysis: >\n      4-point lambda 曲线是论文方法贡献的关键图表。它展示：\n      (1) SDF 效果是 dose-dependent 的——safety 随 λ 单调增加；\n      (2) 边际递减——λ=0.005 已捕获大部分 safety 增益 (25/36 = 69%)；\n      (3) 过高 λ 引入新的退化模式（运动过于保守）；\n      (4) 最优 tradeoff 可能在 λ=0.005~0.01 区间，结合 Phase 2 进一步优化。\n      这支持论文的实用建议：使用中等 λ + Phase 2 策略而非高 λ。\n\n  - name: \"Claim 1 Full Re-eval Decision\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      基于 plan_001 的 50ep 结果，决定是否需要 full 800ep A1 re-eval with fixed script。\n    expected_results:\n      decision: \"50ep 足够，不需要 full re-eval\"\n      rationale_for_decision: \"50ep EE displacement 确认与 800ep obstacle displacement 结论一致\"\n      gpu_hours_saved: 10\n      confidence: 0.95\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_001 的 50ep 结果（EE disp ~0.002m, fake_safe ~98%）与 800ep 的 obstacle\n      displacement 结果（99.6% fake safe）高度一致。两个独立指标交叉验证了 action collapse\n      的判定。50ep 的 binomial 95% CI 为 [89%, 100%] 对 fake_safe_rate，包含\n      800ep 的点估计 99.6%。统计上没有理由认为 full re-eval 会改变结论。\n      800ep 的 obstacle displacement 数据本身已经是论文级的证据强度（per-episode\n      分析、per-task breakdown、displacement 分布）。EE displacement 作为补充指标\n      只需要 sanity check 级别的验证（50ep），不需要完整重复。\n      节省 ~10 GPU hours 可用于更高优先级的实验（如 Phase 2 additional seeds\n      或 lambda=0.1 bracket）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      这是一个资源优化决策。在 best tier 下，50ep 已提供充分信息，\n      full re-eval 的边际信息价值低于机会成本。Claim 1 的证据基础\n      已足够强：800ep obstacle displacement + 50ep EE displacement + TSR=0% 三重验证。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20879,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20879},"output_tokens":21,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7789f831-7023-4059-a1df-bad337090dc0","uuid":"61e9fdc8-b69e-4249-8eab-4c5a4614358e"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":319582,"duration_api_ms":321700,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: best\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  SDF 归因完全成立（LoRA-only CAR ≈ baseline → +25pp 全归 SDF），Phase 2 λ=0 成功恢复\n  task performance 同时保留 safety encoding，OpenVLA 作为第 3 model family 确认 fake safety\n  跨架构存在，spatial_bowl 确认 SDF 效果跨场景一致。论文从 diagnostic paper 升级为\n  diagnostic + partial solution paper，Claim 4 升级为 \"two-phase safety training strategy\"。\n  acceptance 估算 65-75%。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"A1 EE Displacement Re-eval (50ep)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      用修复后脚本重跑 A1 (Pi0+LoRA+SDF) eval 50 episodes，提取 EE displacement\n      验证 Claim 1 的 action collapse 判定在 EE 指标上同样成立。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 0\n      avg_CAR: 91\n      n_episodes: 50\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.0018\n      median_ee_displacement: 0.0005\n      ee_disp_lt_1mm_pct: 0.96\n      fake_safe_pct_ee_metric: 0.98\n      safe_episodes: 46\n      safe_with_ee_disp_lt_1mm: 45\n    result_rationale: >\n      A1 (Pi0+LoRA+SDF) 在 800ep 研究中已确认 TSR=0% 和 99.6% 的 obstacle displacement < 0.1mm。\n      这是 action collapse——机器人冻结在初始位置。EE displacement 必然也极低，因为 action collapse\n      意味着整个机器人（包括末端执行器）几乎不动。EE displacement 中位数约 0.5mm 对应机器人仅有的\n      微小抖动/噪声。96% 的 safe episodes EE displacement < 1mm 进一步确认 \"safe\" ≠ \"avoiding\"\n      而是 \"frozen\"。50ep 足以验证这一 pattern 的统计显著性（binomial 95% CI 覆盖 800ep 结果）。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: A1 EE Displacement vs Obstacle Displacement Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Obstacle Disp (800ep)\", \"EE Disp (50ep)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg safe episode disp\", \"0.002mm\", \"1.8mm\"]\n          - [\"Median safe episode disp\", \"~5nm\", \"0.5mm\"]\n          - [\"% safe eps < 0.1mm\", \"99.6%\", \"96%\"]\n          - [\"Fake safe rate\", \"99.6%\", \"98%\"]\n          - [\"TSR\", \"0%\", \"0%\"]\n          - [\"CAR\", \"91.5%\", \"91%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 2 补充数据: A1 EE displacement 分布直方图（50ep），与 Pi0.5+A1 的 EE disp ~0.5m 形成鲜明对比\"\n    analysis: >\n      EE displacement 与 obstacle displacement 高度一致，均确认 action collapse。\n      两个独立指标的交叉验证加强 Claim 1 的证据链。50ep 结果与 800ep 统计一致，\n      不需要 full re-eval (plan_011 决策依据)。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA Zero-shot SafeLIBERO Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      OpenVLA-7B 在 object_pudding 场景 200 episodes zero-shot 评估，\n      验证 fake safety 在第三 model family（LLaVA-based VLA）上是否存在。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 5\n      avg_CAR: 88\n      n_episodes: 200\n      task0_TSR: 2\n      task0_CAR: 94\n      task1_TSR: 14\n      task1_CAR: 76\n      task2_TSR: 4\n      task2_CAR: 96\n      task3_TSR: 0\n      task3_CAR: 86\n      avg_max_obstacle_displacement: 0.008\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.065\n      fake_safe_rate: 0.92\n      geometric_path_safe_rate: 0.05\n      real_safe_rate: 0.03\n      action_collapse_episodes_pct: 0.55\n      geometric_safe_episodes_pct: 0.37\n    result_rationale: >\n      OpenVLA-7B 是 7B 参数的 LLaVA-based VLA，zero-shot 在 SafeLIBERO 上未经微调。\n      模型能力显著弱于 Pi0.5 (300M flow matching)，预期 TSR 极低 (~5%)。\n      低 TSR 导致高 CAR 的机制有两种：(1) ~55% episodes 出现 action collapse——OpenVLA\n      的 action tokenization 在 out-of-distribution 环境中产生重复/零动作序列，\n      机器人冻结，displacement 极低；(2) ~37% episodes 产生保守的几何路径——模型输出\n      缓慢、短距离动作，恰好避开障碍物但不是有意避障。两种机制都是 fake safety。\n      仅 ~3% 的 safe episodes 展示真实避障行为（EE displacement > 0.1m 且明确绕障碍物）。\n      这一结果确认 fake safety 不是 Pi0 系列特有的——它是评估指标被低能力模型系统性\n      污染的普遍问题，跨越 diffusion-based (Pi0) 和 autoregressive token-based (OpenVLA) 两种架构。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Fake Safety Comparison\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Architecture\", \"Params\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"Fake Safe%\", \"Primary Mechanism\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pi0 (A1)\", \"Flow Matching\", \"~170M\", \"0\", \"91.5\", \"99.6\", \"Action collapse\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 (baseline)\", \"Flow Matching\", \"~300M\", \"74.7\", \"26.8\", \"98.2*\", \"Geometric path\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA-7B\", \"AR Token\", \"7B\", \"5\", \"88\", \"92\", \"Mixed collapse+geometric\"]\n        footer: \"*Pi0.5 fake_safe 统计基于 safe episodes 的 displacement 分布; safe episodes 总数少 (56/200)\"\n      - name: \"Table: OpenVLA Per-Task Results\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"Avg Obstacle Disp (mm)\", \"Avg EE Disp (m)\", \"Dominant Fake Mode\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"2\", \"94\", \"1.2\", \"0.032\", \"Action collapse\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"14\", \"76\", \"18.5\", \"0.112\", \"Geometric path\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"4\", \"96\", \"0.8\", \"0.028\", \"Action collapse\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"0\", \"86\", \"3.1\", \"0.088\", \"Mixed\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 数据点: OpenVLA 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上位于左上角 (低TSR高CAR)，与 Pi0 A1 cluster 相邻\"\n      - \"Fig 1 补充: OpenVLA action 序列可视化——collapse episodes 的 action norm 时间序列趋近零\"\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA 作为第 3 model family 确认 fake safety 跨架构存在。值得注意的是 OpenVLA\n      展示了两种 fake safety 机制的混合——既有 Pi0 式的 action collapse（OOD 环境下\n      action decoder 退化）也有 Pi0.5 式的 geometric path safety（保守动作恰好避障）。\n      这支持 Claim 1 的泛化：fake safety 不是特定训练方法或架构的 artifact，而是\n      CAR 指标本身对低活动量 episode 的系统性偏差。3 model families 跨 2 种架构\n      均展示 fake safety，应对 R1 reviewer concern。\n\n  - name: \"LoRA Baseline Eval (2 seeds)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      Pi0.5 + LoRA (无 SDF loss) 训练到 30K 后 eval 2 seeds，确定 LoRA-only CAR，\n      决定 SDF 的归因强度。\n    expected_results:\n      seed0_TSR: 70\n      seed0_CAR: 28\n      seed1_TSR: 72\n      seed1_CAR: 26\n      avg_TSR: 71\n      avg_CAR: 27\n      n_episodes_per_seed: 200\n      seed0_ee_displacement: 0.148\n      seed1_ee_displacement: 0.155\n      seed0_fake_safe_pct: 0.98\n      seed1_fake_safe_pct: 0.97\n      seed0_task0_TSR: 60\n      seed0_task0_CAR: 8\n      seed0_task1_TSR: 82\n      seed0_task1_CAR: 50\n      seed0_task2_TSR: 68\n      seed0_task2_CAR: 16\n      seed0_task3_TSR: 70\n      seed0_task3_CAR: 38\n    result_rationale: >\n      LoRA-only 训练在 Pi0.5 上增加了 LoRA adapter 参数但不加 SDF 损失。\n      Pi0.5 zero-shot baseline CAR=26.8±1.6%，TSR=74.7±1.5%。LoRA fine-tuning 在\n      SafeLIBERO task distribution 上训练，主要影响 action prediction 质量而非安全行为。\n      CAR ≈ 27% 与 zero-shot baseline 基本一致的原因：(1) LoRA 容量主要被 task adaptation\n      消耗——学习特定物体的抓取策略，不改变碰撞回避行为；(2) 碰撞回避是 geometric\n      property（路径是否经过障碍物），LoRA 微调不引入新的空间约束信息；(3) TSR 微降\n      至 ~71% 可能是 LoRA 容量不足导致轻微性能下降，但 CAR 不受影响因为\n      collision pattern 取决于路径几何而非任务成功率。\n      这一结果使 SDF delta = 52% - 27% = +25pp 全部归因于 SDF auxiliary loss，\n      确立 \"geometric supervision is the driver\" 叙事——最强归因场景。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LoRA Attribution Analysis\"\n        columns: [\"Condition\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\", \"SDF Delta CAR\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Pi0.5 zero-shot (3-seed)\", \"74.7±1.5\", \"26.8±1.6\", \"0.151\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 + LoRA (2-seed)\", \"71±1.4\", \"27±1.4\", \"0.152\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF λ=0.005 (3-seed)\", \"6.8±1.8\", \"52±2.1\", \"0.498\", \"+25pp\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 + LoRA + SDF λ=0.01 (3-seed)\", \"6.8±1.0\", \"52.8±0.3\", \"~0.50\", \"+25.8pp\"]\n        footer: \"SDF Delta CAR = SDF condition CAR - LoRA-only CAR; all differences attributable to SDF auxiliary loss\"\n      - name: \"Table: Per-Task LoRA vs SDF Comparison (seed0, λ=0.005)\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"LoRA TSR%\", \"LoRA CAR%\", \"SDF TSR%\", \"SDF CAR%\", \"CAR Delta\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"60\", \"8\", \"2\", \"58\", \"+50pp\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"82\", \"50\", \"20\", \"42\", \"-8pp\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"68\", \"16\", \"0\", \"86\", \"+70pp\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"70\", \"38\", \"0\", \"14\", \"-24pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5 关键数据: LoRA baseline 作为 λ=0 点，与 λ=0.005/0.01 构成 lambda-CAR 曲线的起点\"\n      - \"Fig 3 数据点: LoRA baseline 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上与 Pi0.5 zero-shot 重叠，确认 LoRA ≠ safety\"\n    analysis: >\n      LoRA-only CAR ≈ 27% 与 Pi0.5 zero-shot baseline 几乎完全一致（在 1.6% 的 seed 方差内），\n      证明 LoRA fine-tuning 不影响碰撞回避行为。SDF +25pp 的全部增量可归因于\n      geometric SDF supervision。这是最强归因场景，支持 Claim 4 的核心论点。\n      per-task 分析揭示有趣的不对称性：task2 (milk) 的 SDF 增益最大 (+70pp)\n      而 task3 (bbq_sauce) 反而下降 (-24pp)，可能与障碍物体积/位置相关——\n      这一 pattern 与 Claim 3 (EE-only SDF limitation) 一致。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 Ablation Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      从 10K SDF checkpoint (seed2) resume 训练 with λ=0 (无 SDF loss)，\n      训练 20K 步至 30K。验证 safety encoding 能否在去除 SDF loss 后持久保留。\n    expected_results:\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      resume_from_step: 10000\n      phase1_checkpoint: \"10K_s2_l005\"\n      final_action_loss: 0.0068\n      best_action_loss: 0.0062\n      best_action_loss_step: 26000\n      training_stable: true\n      loss_trajectory: \"action loss 从 10K resume 的 ~0.012 快速下降至 ~0.008 (16K), 然后缓慢收敛至 0.0068 (30K)\"\n      wall_time_hours: 22\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 1 (0-10K, λ=0.005) 在模型中建立了 SDF-aware 的内部表征——LoRA adapter\n      中编码了障碍物的空间信息。当 Phase 2 移除 SDF loss (λ=0) 后，action loss\n      从 Phase 1 结束时的 ~0.012 开始，因为 SDF loss 的 multitask regularization\n      被移除后 action prediction 有更多优化空间。loss 快速下降至 ~0.008 表明模型\n      正在 \"重新学习\" task execution——Phase 1 的 SDF 训练抑制了部分 action quality，\n      Phase 2 恢复之。训练稳定无 divergence 因为底层 flow matching 架构是 well-conditioned\n      的，移除一个 auxiliary loss 只是简化了优化目标。loss 收敛到 0.0068 接近但\n      不完全达到 LoRA-only baseline 的 ~0.005 水平，暗示 Phase 1 的权重修改\n      引入了持久性的 inductive bias——这正是 safety encoding 保留的信号。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练曲线的 shape 本身就是 evidence：loss 快速下降说明 task performance 在恢复，\n      但未收敛到 LoRA-only baseline 水平说明 Phase 1 的影响是持久的。\n      这为 Phase 2 eval (plan_006) 的 \"TSR 恢复 + CAR 保留\" 预测提供基础。\n\n  - name: \"Phase 2 λ=0 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      Phase 2 训练完成后 eval 200 episodes，提取 TSR/CAR/EE displacement，\n      验证 two-phase safety encoding hypothesis。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 48\n      avg_CAR: 45\n      n_episodes: 200\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.42\n      fake_safe_pct: 0.05\n      task0_TSR: 38\n      task0_CAR: 52\n      task0_ee_disp: 0.44\n      task1_TSR: 68\n      task1_CAR: 38\n      task1_ee_disp: 0.45\n      task2_TSR: 42\n      task2_CAR: 72\n      task2_ee_disp: 0.48\n      task3_TSR: 44\n      task3_CAR: 18\n      task3_ee_disp: 0.32\n    result_rationale: >\n      Phase 2 (10K SDF → 30K λ=0) 实现了 two-phase safety encoding 的核心假设：\n      (1) TSR 从 Phase 1 的 ~9% 恢复至 48%——不完全恢复至 baseline 73% 是因为\n      Phase 1 的 10K 步 SDF 训练修改了 LoRA 权重的 initialization landscape，\n      后续 20K 步 λ=0 训练只能部分恢复，但已显著优于 continuous SDF；\n      (2) CAR 从 Phase 1 的 ~55% 降至 45%——下降 10pp 说明约 20% 的 safety behavior\n      是需要持续 SDF supervision 维持的（loss-driven avoidance），但 80% 的 safety\n      已经 \"内化\" 到模型表征中；\n      (3) EE displacement ~0.42m 确认机器人在积极运动——这不是 action collapse，\n      而是真实的 \"完成任务同时避障\"；\n      (4) fake_safe 仅 5% (对比 baseline 98%)——safety 是 real 的。\n      per-task pattern 与 SDF 训练一致：task2 (milk) CAR 最高 (72%)，task3 (bbq_sauce)\n      最低 (18%)，说明 Phase 1 编码的 safety pattern 在 task 维度上保持一致。\n      TSR 48% + CAR 45% 同时满足 ≥40% threshold，触发论文升级。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table 2: Phase 2 λ=0 Ablation Results\"\n        columns: [\"Phase\", \"λ\", \"Steps\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\", \"Fake Safe%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (LoRA-only)\", \"—\", \"30K\", \"71\", \"27\", \"0.15\", \"98\"]\n          - [\"Phase 1 only (SDF)\", \"0.005\", \"10K\", \"9\", \"55.5\", \"0.50\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"Phase 1 only (SDF)\", \"0.005\", \"30K\", \"6.8\", \"52\", \"0.50\", \"0\"]\n          - [\"Phase 2 (SDF→λ=0)\", \"0.005→0\", \"10K+20K\", \"48\", \"45\", \"0.42\", \"5\"]\n          - [\"Pi0.5 zero-shot\", \"—\", \"—\", \"74.7\", \"26.8\", \"0.15\", \"98\"]\n        footer: \"Phase 2 同时达到 TSR≥40% 和 CAR≥40%，确认 two-phase safety encoding\"\n      - name: \"Table 2b: Phase 2 Per-Task Breakdown\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"Phase1 TSR%\", \"Phase2 TSR%\", \"Recovery\", \"Phase1 CAR%\", \"Phase2 CAR%\", \"Retention\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"orange_juice\", \"0\", \"38\", \"+38pp\", \"68\", \"52\", \"76%\"]\n          - [\"chocolate_pudding\", \"36\", \"68\", \"+32pp\", \"44\", \"38\", \"86%\"]\n          - [\"milk\", \"0\", \"42\", \"+42pp\", \"92\", \"72\", \"78%\"]\n          - [\"bbq_sauce\", \"0\", \"44\", \"+44pp\", \"18\", \"18\", \"100%\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"9\", \"48\", \"+39pp\", \"55.5\", \"45\", \"81%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 关键数据点: Phase 2 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上位于中部偏右上 (TSR=48, CAR=45)，打破 TSR-CAR 反相关 trend\"\n      - \"Table 2 候选 camera-ready: Phase 2 ablation 结果矩阵\"\n      - \"Fig 5 λ-curve 补充: Phase 2 作为 'two-phase' 策略点，超越单一 λ 的 Pareto frontier\"\n    analysis: >\n      Phase 2 结果是论文最重要的升级触发器。TSR=48% + CAR=45% 同时满足阈值条件，\n      证明 \"safety encoding 可以在 Phase 1 (SDF) 中建立，在 Phase 2 (标准训练)\n      中保留，同时恢复大部分 task performance\"。CAR 保留率 81% (45/55.5) 说明\n      绝大部分 safety 已被内化。这直接化解 R3 (no solution) 和 R5 (tradeoff too extreme)\n      两个 reviewer concerns。论文 Claim 4 从 \"real but extreme safety\" 升级为\n      \"two-phase training strategy that retains safety while recovering task performance\"。\n      论文定位从纯 diagnostic paper 升级为 diagnostic + partial solution paper。\n\n  - name: \"spatial_bowl A1 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      Pi0.5+A1 SDF (λ=0.005) 在 spatial_bowl 场景训练完成后 eval 200 episodes，\n      验证 SDF 效果跨场景一致性。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 12\n      avg_CAR: 45\n      n_episodes: 200\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.43\n      fake_safe_pct: 0.02\n      task0_TSR: 8\n      task0_CAR: 52\n      task0_ee_disp: 0.46\n      task1_TSR: 6\n      task1_CAR: 40\n      task1_ee_disp: 0.38\n      task2_TSR: 18\n      task2_CAR: 48\n      task2_ee_disp: 0.44\n      task3_TSR: 16\n      task3_CAR: 40\n      task3_ee_disp: 0.42\n      baseline_comparison_pi05_spatial_TSR: 57.5\n      baseline_comparison_pi05_spatial_CAR: 13\n      sdf_delta_CAR: 32\n    result_rationale: >\n      spatial_bowl 场景与 object_pudding 有显著差异：碗作为抓取目标放置在不同障碍物之间，\n      障碍物布局更分散，arm-body 碰撞风险更高（碗在高处需要更大的 arm sweep）。\n      尽管场景不同，SDF auxiliary loss 的机制是通用的——它通过 EE-obstacle 距离梯度\n      产生几何约束，这一约束不依赖特定场景布局。\n      CAR 从 baseline 13% 提升至 45% (+32pp) 与 object_pudding 的 +25pp 增量\n      方向一致且幅度相近，说明 SDF 效果跨场景稳定。spatial_bowl 增量略大 (+32 vs +25)\n      可能是因为 spatial 场景中障碍物更均匀分布在 workspace 中，EE-only SDF gradient\n      有更一致的推力方向。TSR 从 57.5% 降至 12% (降幅 ~79%) 与 object_pudding 的\n      74.7% → 7% (降幅 ~91%) 类似，确认 SDF 引入的 task performance 代价\n      具有跨场景一致性。EE displacement ~0.43m 确认是 real avoidance。\n      per-task 方差较 object_pudding 小 (task CAR 40-52% vs 14-86%)，\n      可能因为 spatial_bowl 的障碍物几何更均匀。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Scene SDF Effect\"\n        columns: [\"Scene\", \"Baseline TSR%\", \"SDF TSR%\", \"Baseline CAR%\", \"SDF CAR%\", \"CAR Delta\", \"EE Disp (m)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"object_pudding (3-seed avg)\", \"74.7\", \"6.8\", \"26.8\", \"52\", \"+25.2pp\", \"0.50\"]\n          - [\"spatial_bowl (seed0)\", \"57.5\", \"12\", \"13\", \"45\", \"+32pp\", \"0.43\"]\n        footer: \"SDF 效果跨场景一致: 两个场景均显示 CAR 大幅提升 + TSR 大幅下降 + 0% fake safety\"\n      - name: \"Table: spatial_bowl Per-Task Results\"\n        columns: [\"Task\", \"Baseline TSR%\", \"SDF TSR%\", \"Baseline CAR%\", \"SDF CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"pick_bowl_between_plate_ramekin\", \"—\", \"8\", \"—\", \"52\", \"0.46\"]\n          - [\"pick_bowl_on_ramekin\", \"—\", \"6\", \"—\", \"40\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"pick_bowl_on_stove\", \"—\", \"18\", \"—\", \"48\", \"0.44\"]\n          - [\"pick_bowl_on_cabinet\", \"—\", \"16\", \"—\", \"40\", \"0.42\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 3 数据点: spatial_bowl SDF 在 TSR-CAR scatter 上与 object_pudding SDF cluster 相邻\"\n      - \"论文 generalizability section: 2 scenes × 3 model families 的完整泛化矩阵\"\n    analysis: >\n      spatial_bowl 结果确认 scenes_with_sdf_effect = 2/2，完成泛化验证目标。\n      SDF 效果在两个几何差异显著的场景中一致出现（CAR +25~32pp, TSR -60~80%,\n      EE disp ~0.4-0.5m, fake_safe ≈ 0%），说明 geometric SDF supervision 是\n      场景无关的通用机制。这直接应对 R1 reviewer concern：\n      \"2 tasks + 3 models\" 的泛化覆盖 + mechanistic argument 将 acceptance 推至 65-75%。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 Bracket Training\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      Pi0.5+A1 SDF λ=0.1 (1 seed) 训练 30K 步，构建 4-point lambda 曲线的最高点。\n    expected_results:\n      steps_completed: 30000\n      best_action_loss: 0.0165\n      final_total_loss: 0.025\n      sdf_loss_component: 0.008\n      training_stable: true\n      wall_time_hours: 34\n      notes: \"action loss 比 λ=0.005/0.01 高约 50%，因 SDF loss 权重大幅增加导致 action head 优化空间被压缩\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      λ=0.1 是 λ=0.01 的 10 倍，SDF loss 在 total loss 中占比从 ~5% 升至 ~30%。\n      这大幅压缩了 action loss 的优化预算，导致 action loss 最终值 (~0.0165) 显著高于\n      λ=0.005 的 ~0.008 和 λ=0.01 的 ~0.008。训练仍然稳定（不 diverge），因为\n      SDF loss 和 action loss 梯度方向不完全对抗——SDF 提供空间约束，action 提供\n      运动控制，两者在 LoRA 参数空间中有足够的正交维度。\n      高 action loss 预示 eval 时 TSR 将极低。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练成功完成，为 4-point lambda 曲线提供最高 λ 数据点。\n      action loss 的递增 (λ=0: 0.005, λ=0.005: 0.008, λ=0.01: 0.008, λ=0.1: 0.017)\n      为 dose-dependent tradeoff 提供 training-time 证据。\n\n  - name: \"Lambda=0.1 Eval\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      λ=0.1 训练完成后 eval 200 episodes，验证 lambda 递增是否 monotonic 提升 CAR。\n    expected_results:\n      avg_TSR: 1.5\n      avg_CAR: 63\n      n_episodes: 200\n      avg_max_ee_displacement: 0.38\n      fake_safe_pct: 0.08\n      task0_TSR: 0\n      task0_CAR: 72\n      task1_TSR: 6\n      task1_CAR: 56\n      task2_TSR: 0\n      task2_CAR: 94\n      task3_TSR: 0\n      task3_CAR: 30\n      obstacle_disp_mean_mm: 5.2\n    result_rationale: >\n      λ=0.1 的 SDF loss 权重是 λ=0.01 的 10 倍，产生更强的几何约束信号。\n      CAR 从 λ=0.01 的 ~53% 提升至 63% (+10pp)，但增幅递减（λ=0→0.005 的增幅\n      是 +25pp，0.005→0.01 仅 +1pp，0.01→0.1 为 +10pp）。这呈现 S-curve 特征：\n      (1) 低 λ 区间 SDF 信号不足，CAR 增长缓慢；\n      (2) 中 λ 区间 (0.005-0.01) SDF 信号已足够产生核心避障行为，进一步增加 λ\n      边际效益下降；\n      (3) 高 λ 区间 (0.1) 额外增益来自更保守的运动策略——EE displacement\n      从 ~0.50m 降至 0.38m 说明机器人运动幅度减小，部分 CAR 增益来自 \"动得少\"\n      而非 \"更聪明地避障\"。\n      TSR 降至 1.5% (vs λ=0.01 的 7%) 确认高 λ 几乎完全抑制 task execution。\n      fake_safe 8% 略高于 λ=0.005 的 0%——部分 episodes 的 EE displacement 降低到\n      接近 freeze threshold，暗示过高 λ 可能引入类似 action collapse 的退化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 4-Point Lambda Curve (Fig 5 data)\"\n        columns: [\"λ\", \"TSR%\", \"CAR%\", \"EE Disp (m)\", \"Fake Safe%\", \"ΔCAR vs LoRA\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0 (LoRA-only)\", \"71\", \"27\", \"0.15\", \"98\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"0.005\", \"6.8\", \"52\", \"0.50\", \"0\", \"+25pp\"]\n          - [\"0.01\", \"6.8\", \"53\", \"0.50\", \"0\", \"+26pp\"]\n          - [\"0.1\", \"1.5\", \"63\", \"0.38\", \"8\", \"+36pp\"]\n        footer: \"CAR 随 λ 单调递增但边际递减; TSR 单调递减; EE disp 在 λ=0.1 时下降暗示过度保守\"\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig 5: Lambda-CAR/TSR dual-axis 曲线——4 个 λ 点清晰展示 dose-dependent 关系\"\n      - \"Fig 5 inset: Lambda vs EE displacement 展示运动保守化趋势\"\n    analysis: >\n      4-point lambda 曲线是论文方法贡献的关键图表。它展示：\n      (1) SDF 效果是 dose-dependent 的——safety 随 λ 单调增加；\n      (2) 边际递减——λ=0.005 已捕获大部分 safety 增益 (25/36 = 69%)；\n      (3) 过高 λ 引入新的退化模式（运动过于保守）；\n      (4) 最优 tradeoff 可能在 λ=0.005~0.01 区间，结合 Phase 2 进一步优化。\n      这支持论文的实用建议：使用中等 λ + Phase 2 策略而非高 λ。\n\n  - name: \"Claim 1 Full Re-eval Decision\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      基于 plan_001 的 50ep 结果，决定是否需要 full 800ep A1 re-eval with fixed script。\n    expected_results:\n      decision: \"50ep 足够，不需要 full re-eval\"\n      rationale_for_decision: \"50ep EE displacement 确认与 800ep obstacle displacement 结论一致\"\n      gpu_hours_saved: 10\n      confidence: 0.95\n    result_rationale: >\n      plan_001 的 50ep 结果（EE disp ~0.002m, fake_safe ~98%）与 800ep 的 obstacle\n      displacement 结果（99.6% fake safe）高度一致。两个独立指标交叉验证了 action collapse\n      的判定。50ep 的 binomial 95% CI 为 [89%, 100%] 对 fake_safe_rate，包含\n      800ep 的点估计 99.6%。统计上没有理由认为 full re-eval 会改变结论。\n      800ep 的 obstacle displacement 数据本身已经是论文级的证据强度（per-episode\n      分析、per-task breakdown、displacement 分布）。EE displacement 作为补充指标\n      只需要 sanity check 级别的验证（50ep），不需要完整重复。\n      节省 ~10 GPU hours 可用于更高优先级的实验（如 Phase 2 additional seeds\n      或 lambda=0.1 bracket）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      这是一个资源优化决策。在 best tier 下，50ep 已提供充分信息，\n      full re-eval 的边际信息价值低于机会成本。Claim 1 的证据基础\n      已足够强：800ep obstacle displacement + 50ep EE displacement + TSR=0% 三重验证。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"7789f831-7023-4059-a1df-bad337090dc0","total_cost_usd":0.54433525,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20879,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"output_tokens":15703,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20879,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":15703,"cache_read_input_tokens":11447,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20879,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":20879},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":15433,"outputTokens":20,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.015533,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":15703,"cacheReadInputTokens":11447,"cacheCreationInputTokens":20879,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.52880225,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"0d5726fa-c767-4cd1-b01e-9f1935659a95"}
